From b94a6a4d9c56980e5df3ea930b568730ed9c29d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 03:00:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/39] feat: fix streak bonus formula, All Players deposit,
 and new tabs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Streak tab: fix Est. Bonus formula to use periodDeposit × bonusPct / 100
  (was incorrectly using totalReward × bonusPct); fix header to show
  "X% of period deposit" instead of "100% of total reward"
- All Players tab: show total campaign deposit in daily mode using
  depositByPlayer map aggregated from all daily_turnover_entries;
  previously showed "—" for most players because it read real platform data
- loadCampaignSummary: add depositByPlayer aggregation from raw entries
  (all entries, not just qualifying ones) and expose via summaryData
- Add Streak tab (per-player streak progress + bonus payout table) and
  Inactive tab (players with zero qualifying days across campaign period)
- Add per-date payout tracking via daily_turnover_entries payout_status /
  payout_date columns (updateDailyPayout); streak bonus badge in Payout tab
- campaignEditor: extend buildCampaignUpdate with turnover_multiplier and
  payout templates (en/my/cn)
- Migration: add turnover_multiplier column to campaigns table

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
